  "Para 1: 'ראש הפ'' expanded as רֹאשׁ הַפֶּרֶק (the opening of the haftarah passage, Hoshea 12:13 'ויברח יעקב'); it could also be read רֹאשׁ הַפָּרָשָׁה. Uncertain.",
  "Para 1: '(ח\"א א)' after בזוה\"ק expanded as (חֵלֶק א, דַּף א), i.e. Zohar I:1a (the 'shoshanah' opening).",
  "Para 1: 'עם עשר סממני הקטורת' - the incense had eleven spices; read as 'the ten [other] spices' with galbanum. Kept as printed; no correction proposed.",
  "Para 2: 'בס' הנגלים' expanded בְּסִפְרֵי הַנִּגְלִים and 'בס\"ת' (twice) as בְּסִתְרֵי תּוֹרָה (Sitrei Torah), by context.",
  "Para 2: Zohar quote 'ויקרה היא מפנינים' has a vav not found in Mishlei 3:15 (יְקָרָה הִיא מִפְּנִינִים); kept as printed (it may reflect the Zohar's own text).",
  "Para 4: Devarim 1:11 is printed 'אלהי אבותיכם יוסף' (Masoretic אֲבוֹתֵכֶם יֹסֵף) and Bereishit 30:30 'אותך' (Masoretic אֹתְךָ), Mishlei 28:13 'ירוחם' (Masoretic יְרֻחָם); the printed full spellings are kept and vocalized.",
  "Para 4: first 'א\"ל' expanded אָמְרוּ לוֹ and second אָמַר לָהֶם, following Rashi on Devarim 1:11."
